  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Diplomatic Consensus on Humanitarian Access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build consensus on a set of principles and supporting actions to improve humanitarian access in situations where State consent for humanitarian operations is withheld for access to areas outside the effective control of the State, through consultation with states and other key stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
